s at a reasonable price. I love the burgers, the grilled chicken Caesar salad, the chicken wings, and the omelets too! A fabulous meeting place, and addition to the neighborhood :)"},{"business_id":"bjxpXg1gOwHsN_yaVzJCWQ","review_id":"0g2Flg_wCt_FlixgJaWSsA","date":"2020-11-19T22:09:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9094181060791016,"text_excerpt":"Had a great meal here! Came in on a Saturday, and the tables were distanced and masks etc. were all enforced. They had some delicious $6 margaritas that we absolutely annihilated. For food, we got the following (a bunch of things most of us split): 1. The House-Made Boudin Balls - wow, just insane. Rich, of course, but super tasty if you are down with this. 2. Sausage and chicken gumbo (what they had that day, it changes) - great gumbo, not too rich but pretty dark. 3. Cajun Style Butter Beans - I should have ordered more of this. We mauled it. It was insane. Did I mention we mauled this? Seriously, you should get this. It's SO GOOD. 4. Chicken tacos - decent, would definitely get again, ..."},{"business_id":"bjxpXg1gOwHsN_yaVzJCWQ","review_id":"Fi8tR61yzFdKlyZmvYoVWw","date":"2017-03-21T19:09:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8916876316070557,"text_excerpt":"my fave salad is here with a moment on the grill. grilling the romaine for a caesar salad is killer. fries with bechamel. wings, even daily specials rock up in here. great art. great backyard great people. kudos."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"bjxpXg1gOwHsN_yaVzJCWQ","photo_id":"a0UhrigM3kphuTxuxssVVg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/a0UhrigM3kphuTxuxssVVg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8708409070968628},{"business_id":"bjxpXg1gOwHsN_yaVzJCWQ","photo_id":"ipQv-DvzAm3DVci9zRJL-g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ipQv-DvzAm3DVci9zRJL-g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8688662052154541},{"business_id":"bjxpXg1gOwHsN_yaVzJCWQ","photo_id":"aP7rR_UsFAivITX_E3PN3g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/aP7rR_UsFAivITX_E3PN3g.jpg","visual_repre